        "id": "intro-comment",
        "type": "nodetool.workflows.base_node.Comment",
        "data": {
          "comment": "# Pull a Field out of JSON Text\n\nReads one value from JSON text by following a dotted path. Use it to pull a single field out of an API response or a config string.\n\n**How it works:** \"JSON text\" holds a small user record. \"Read user.name\" parses it and walks the path one key at a time, returning \"Ada\". \"Value\" shows the result. It runs locally with no model or key.\n\n**Try this:** Set the path on \"Read user.name\" to user.role and confirm that \"Value\" shows \"engineer\"."
        },
        "ui_properties": {
